title: Rear Camera 'Full View Not Available' Warning Overlay Removal
raw_community_title: Remove "Full view not available" message on Sync camera screen
  while in motion
category: Cameras and ADAS
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2026
trim: All
validated: true
verified_by: Kyle / AsBuiltPro & Lightning Community
source_sheet: F-150 Lightning FORScan Thread
notes: Removes motion warning message overlay on Sync camera screen. Reboot APIM after
  applying.
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-02-02
  mask: xxx* xxxx xx--
  nibbles:
  - nibble: 3
    community_instruction: If 0 change to 1, if 2 change to 3, if 4 change to 5, if
      6 change to 7.
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 0
      feature_name: Powerflow Type (PT)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 2
      action: 0
      feature_name: Climate Bar (CB)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 1
      action: 0
      feature_name: Climate Bar (CB)
      target_state: Disabled
    - bit: 0
      action: 0
      feature_name: Climate Bar (CB)
      target_state: Disabled
validation_status: validated
